{{!
    @template mod_playervideo/question_preview

    A question's text and, for multichoice/truefalse, its answer options with the correct ones
    in bold. Used on its own and as a partial inside mod_playervideo/batch_candidates.
    questiontext and answers[].text are Question Bank content already run through format_text()
    with the module context on the server (question_service), so they are rendered unescaped;
    the bold wrapper around a correct answer is template markup, not data.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "questiontext": "<p>Which is a volcano?</p>",
        "answers": [
            {"text": "Etna", "correct": true},
            {"text": "Ganges", "correct": false}
        ]
    }
}}
<div>{{{questiontext}}}</div>
{{#answers.0}}
<ul class="mb-1">
    {{#answers}}
    <li>{{#correct}}<strong>{{/correct}}{{{text}}}{{#correct}}</strong>{{/correct}}</li>
    {{/answers}}
</ul>
{{/answers.0}}
